<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>App Store on 知识铺的博客</title><link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/tags/App-Store/</link><description>Recent content in App Store on 知识铺的博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://index.zshipu.com/geek/tags/App-Store/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>苹果调整欧盟应用商店收费，降低开发者成本</title><link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260818/%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E6%AC%A7%E7%9B%9F%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%95%86%E5%BA%97%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%B9%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260818/%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E6%AC%A7%E7%9B%9F%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%95%86%E5%BA%97%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%B9%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC/</guid><description>苹果公司近日宣布对欧盟地区的App Store收费政策进行重大调整，以回应监管机构对数字市场法案（DMA）实施方式的质疑。这一变化直接影响了开发者的成本结构和用户的选择范围。 新收费结构：从安装费到佣金 根据苹果的公告，新政策将取代原有的按次安装收费模式，改为对通过App Store以外</description></item></channel></rss>